{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県出身！\n和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新が遅くなってごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援のコメントをいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯が復活しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやら充電器が壊れてたみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんが、もう使わないから〜って充電器をくれました\nありがとう〜せいたん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壊れてる間...\nまいやんが朝起こしてくれたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんが起こしてくれたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！泊まりに来てくれてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが充電器貸してくれたり...等々..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆、今は舞台で精神的にも身体的にも本当に忙しいくて大変な時なのに...\n優しくしてくれる...素敵なメンバーですまあやは幸せです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は！プリンシパルで16人の中にこの前入ることが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前を呼ばれたときは、えっ！？\n今、和田まあやって言ったの！？\nってアタフタしてしまいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しすぎて声でないし、台詞も立ち位置も間違えはしなかったんだけどめっちゃ緊張しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のプリンシパルでは入ることが出来なかったので、これで１人でも多くのファンの皆様に笑顔になってもらえてたら嬉しいなぁ〜と思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーや家族、スタッフさん、そしてファンの皆様たちにも沢山の\n『オメデトウ』を言ってもらってとっても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕が降りてすぐにカズミンや、生駒ちゃん、マイマイ......沢山のmemberが抱きついて来てくれて喜んでくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆がとっても喜んでくれて凄く嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の皆様...温かい拍手をありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（大切な仲間familyです）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれる前までは、正直な気持ちを言うと...16役覚えた意味ないかも...\nって少し焦ってて、ずっとマイナス思考になってたけど、\n精一杯頑張って、皆に楽しかったよ！\nって言ってもらえたり、自分でも毎日頑張ってやる事が大事なんだな！って切り替えることもできました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとうに応援してくださった方、\n投票してくださった方、\n有難う御座いました\nこれないけど応援やアドバイスくれた方、ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが\nまあやのセリフの時に\n「まあや、まあや、」って言って応援してくれてて、\n楽屋に帰ってきた時にも、ミサミサから、皆が...「まあや、まあや」って言ってたよ♪って教えてくれて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは、こんなにも素敵なメンバーやスタッフさん、そして、まあやを思ってくれる人達に出会えた事に感謝します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやがまだまだなのはわかってます\nだから\nこれからもまだまだ頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつかもしれないけど、成長する姿を見ていて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでも、まあやの頑張りを見て自分も頑張る！って言ってくれたり、応援してるよ！って言ってくれてるのをみると益々パワーアップします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、少し調子が悪かったけど\n今日は復活してみせるよ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母さん達がこっそりとグッズを買いに来てたみたい〜笑\n夜は久しぶりに一緒に寝たよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも頑張るぞー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も身体に気を付けて下さい\n応援してるよ〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/07/9631516/0006.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}